; --- The 2026-08-28 layout rebuild: the procession BENDS and the ring becomes a CRESCENT. Six markers on a 28 m circle
; --- around a nest at the exact centre was the third rock ring in a row - the Wild roost and the ash
; --- roost had the same plan - and a perfect circle is not what eight hundred years of one mind
; --- living somewhere looks like. The avenue now runs north from the southern seam in an irregular
; --- double file, turns NORTH-WEST at (0, 6), and opens into a crescent of standing stones whose
; --- mouth faces west. The nest is at (-6, -18), inside the crescent's arms. THE HOARD IS BEHIND THE
; --- EAST HORN at (12, -12), with two more stones screening it: there is no sightline to it from any
; --- point on the avenue, so the tome is something you go round the back to find rather than the
; --- second thing you see on arrival.

